// # Unified Marine Hydrodynamics & Autonomous Underwater Vehicles Facade
//
// Logline: Master facade re-exporting all 49 submodules across marine hydrodynamics, AUV dynamics, acoustics, navigation, and control.
//
// Setup: Pure module shim and unified API providing single-import access to the complete openOODA Underwater Robotics stack.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import 49 modular hydrodynamics, added mass, acoustic navigation, sonar perception, nonlinear control, and swarm submodules.
//   2. Re-export public AUV configurations, factory constructors, and controller shims.
//   3. Maintain full backwards compatibility and uniform type access for openOODA subsea applications.
//   4. Expose high-level mission coordinator and unified autonomous underwater vehicle system factory.

